{
  // Hawkes Punch's space: deep blue-black, one hard sun, rim light, big saturated planets, stars that don't twinkle (the set's star sphere). High contrast, rich blacks,
  // a blue-to-warm split, sunRim on silhouettes so a stunt reads against a planet, a little faceFill so eye sockets never go black. Long lenses and long smooth tracks.
  // Use as a whole-video style, or take its grade as the moods space_alone, space_play and space_huge do over the clinic style.
  "about": "Deep space with one hard sun: blue-black, rim-lit silhouettes, big saturated planets, no twinkle. Flights, chases, anything huge.",
